# Claude Code OAuth token — run `claude setup-token` on your host and paste the
# result here. Lets the container use your Claude subscription instead of an API key.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# Or meter it against an Anthropic API key instead — uncomment and fill in:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# GitHub token. /ship does more than read issues: it assigns, pushes a branch,
# opens a PR and queues the squash merge. A fine-grained token on withplumix/plumix
# needs Contents: read+write, Pull requests: read+write, Issues: read+write,
# Metadata: read. https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
GH_TOKEN=
